WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,910
The man asking you for help with this wound sounds so familiar.

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:05,310
You are talking about yourself. If I tell you seriously, don’t believe him.

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:06,870
Don't believe a word

4
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:07,910
Then I can believe you

5
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:13,810
How come women are so easy to deceive men? They treat you so well. Either they want to pick you up or they want to use you to deceive normal men who have no money.

6
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:14,970
I wish I could hide the wound well

7
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:16,410
It's embarrassing for a woman to see

8
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:17,850
Don't be fooled by men again

9
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,260
Men are only bad and very bad

10
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:24,310
There's nothing good left. I understand. Then get out of here.

11
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:33,780
He has a point

12
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,590
Start with him first

13
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,640
He trained the base into a tiger and wolf team

14
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,500
Such a tiger

15
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,220
I can let it out
